<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">sensory-veil</ansi> spell

The <ansi fg="command">Sensory Veil</ansi> spell drapes a Chrysalis shroud over the target's
perceptions, clouding their ability to accurately sense the world
around them. The veiled target moves through a haze of confusion,
their awareness of the battlefield significantly diminished.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast sensory-veil [target]</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Details: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Type:        </ansi> Harm Single
  <ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> Mental
  <ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> 8
  <ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> 50
  <ansi fg="yellow">Defense:     </ansi> Mental — perception and willpower resist the veil
  <ansi fg="yellow">Effect:      </ansi> Debuff — clouds the target's perception

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help spells</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help cast</ansi>
